// Splice Bots' rules, ported from the jam build's SpliceRules module (GitHub #13653): pure game rules
// with no engine calls, the same names and meanings as the C++ so a rule can be checked against
// it, and the C++ rule tests (SpliceTests/Rules) ported as checks beside each module (`X-checks.coax`,
// each check named after its C++ test). The tables they read (items.csv, robots.csv) come from the
// import bundle; tools/data-check.coax checks the rules against them. What is ported and what is left
// is on #13653.
//   coax/bin/coax test metaverse/splice-bots/rules/rules.coax
